 zombies.\n \ud83c\udfc3 Survive the Apocalypse \u2013 Explore post-apocalyptic environments, scavenge for supplies, and stay alive against the undead.\n \ud83c\udfaf Upgrade and Customize \u2013 Improve your arsenal, unlock new skills, and become the ultimate zombie hunter.\n \ud83d\udc80 Thrilling Challenges \u2013 From fast zombies to massive bosses, every level will test your shooting and survival skills.\nDo you have what it takes to survive? Enter the world of Dead Triger Zombie Shooter Last Survival and prove your skills in the ultimate fight for life.", "short_description": "Fight hordes of zombies and survive the apocalypse in Dead Triger Zombie Shooter Last Survival!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fuelup-games-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FuelUp Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fuelup-games/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "34019612694350734"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1467792114726024"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "928492416431313"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1815864049094670"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1815864049094670"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1779123600, "